@startuml F5.10-ERRO-403-sem-export-run
title F5.10-ERRO-403 — 403 sem export.run
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ExportController" as Ctrl

Sec -> WebApp: Solicitar exportação
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /exportacoes/{kind}
note right of Jwt
  export.run ausente
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403 access_denied
WebApp --> Sec: Problem Details

@enduml
